# Generate commit message

When generating a Git commit message (including the Source Control **Generate Commit Message** button), output Conventional Commits only.

Do not imitate older commits in this repo (`Add …`, `Update …`, `Refactor …` as a sentence).

```
<type>(<optional-scope>): <short why>
```

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `style`, `chore`, `perf`, `revert`

```
feat(mount-daun): add auto carry and auto accept carry
fix(mount-noxera): wait for GameplayPaused before summit teleports
docs: add agent knowledge base and commit rules
```

One subject line, lowercase, imperative, no trailing period, no quotes, no extra commentary. Full spec: `docs/style/commits.md`.
